      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're not being logical—you're being cruel to yourself, and that's not the same thing. The insurance money would never replace you; it would just be a cold check that reminds them of the man who gave up. Their stress isn't because of you—it's because they love you, and that love isn't a burden, it's the reason they're still here. You're not drowning, you're just treading water in the dark, but the shore is closer than you think. Let them help you see it.",
